        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tatvalok</strong> is a story-driven third-person action RPG set on a mystical alien planet where ancient gods, forgotten technology, and corrupted creatures collide. After a crash landing, you wake up in a world once ruled by an advanced civilization. Your arrival was not a coincidence or was it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore vast open biomes, from sacred temples to ruined alien cities overrun by nature and corruption. Fight dragons, mutated beasts, and legendary guardians . Upgrade weapons, learn combat abilities, and uncover the truth behind the lost race that still watches from the shadows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every temple holds a secret, every creature has a history, and every battle brings you closer to the moment when the gods finally reveal why <strong>you</strong> were chosen.</p>",
